  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n**((4x²-9y²)³+(9y²-49z²)³+(49z²-4x²)³)/((2x-3y)³+(3y-7z)³+(7z-2x)³)**\n\n**Concept Used:**\n\na³ + b³ + c³ = 3abc if a + b + c = 0\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n**((4x²-9y²)³+(9y²-49z²)³+(49z²-4x²)³)/((2x-3y)³+(3y-7z)³+(7z-2x)³)**\n\n⇒ 4x² - 9y² + 9y² - 49z² + 49² - 4x² = 0\n\n⇒ (4x²-9y²)³+(9y²-49z²)³+(49z²-4x²)³ = 3(4x2 - 9y2)(9y2 - 49z2)(492 - 4x²)\n\nSimilarly,\n\n⇒ 2x - 3y + 3y - 7z + 7z - 2x = 0\n\n⇒ (2x-3y)³+(3y-7z)³+(7z-2x)³ = 3(2x - 3y)(3y - 7z)(7z - 2x)\n\n⇒ (3(4x²-9y²)(9y²-49z²)(49z²-4x²))/(3(2x-3y)(3y-7z)(7z-2x))\n\n⇒ ((2x-3y)(2x+3y)(3y-7z)(3y+7z)(7z-2x)(7z+2x))/((2x-3y)(3y-7z)(7z-2x))\n\n⇒ (2x+3y)(3y+7z)(7z+2x)\n\n**∴ Option 1 is the correct answer.**",
